                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Jefferson City politicians who are pushing HB 301 and SB 78 want to control St. Louis so badly, yet they have issues in their own districts they should be tackling.\n\nRural hospitals are closing, forcing their constituents to travel hundreds of miles to seek healthcare.",
