                "retweet_count": 1944,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Ordering 1.1 million people to evacuate an area in 24 hours is an impossible task. There are people who remain in hospitals in northern Gaza who can\u2019t be moved.\n\nIsrael must rescind the order, abide by international law & prevent mass atrocities against the Palestinian people.",
