                "retweet_count": 5876,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The death toll in Gaza has now exceeded 10,000 people, nearly half of which are children, and tens of thousands have been injured.\n\nHospitals have been bombed, meaning many of those injured lack access to care.\n\nThis must end.\n\n#CeasefireNOW",
