                "reply_count": 2256,
                "retweet_count": 8352,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Doctors should not have to beg for a ceasefire.\n\nNurses should not have to beg for a ceasefire.\n\nAs a nurse, I cannot imagine the difficulty of taking care of patients while being bombed.\n\nIt does not have to be like this. \n\nWhere is the collective humanity?",
