                "retweet_count": 83,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In my career as a nurse, I fought for my patients. Now, I'm honored to have the support of @NationalNurses.\n\nWe'll always fight for Medicare for All & a holistic healthcare system that works for providers, staff & the people entrusted in their care, not the shareholders\u2019 profits. https://t.co/B1d5SmGYRd",
