                "retweet_count": 304,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As a nurse, I fought for my patients. As a Congresswoman, I'm fighting for everybody. I'm honored to have the support of National Nurses United, and proud to have them on #TeamCori.",
